<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DAN" style="id" />
  <para style="h">DANIEL</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk pa Daniel</para>
  <para style="toc2">Daniel</para>
  <para style="toc3">Dan</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk pa</para>
  <para style="mt1">DANIEL</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Buk pa Daniel </char> kicoyo ikare ma onongo Lujudaya tye kadeno can malit atikatika ite loc pa rwot ma pe ngeyo Lubanga. Lacoc otiyo ki ododo me cuku cwiny jo pa Lubanga ma ikare meno ni, Lubanga biloyo laloc ma lageroni, ci bidwoko loc bot jone kikome.</para>
  <para style="ip">Buk man tye i dul aryo madongo: (1) Dul mukwongo tito pi Daniel ki luwote ma onongo kiterogi i opii i lobo pa Lurok. Jo magi pi niyegi oweko gin gubedo ki loc ikom lukworgi. Ododo man okati ikare me loc pa jo Babilon ki jo Percia. (2) Dul me aryo me buk man tito pi ginanyuta ma Daniel oneno ma nyutu kit ma loc mapatpat biile malo ka dok gitur kwede woko, kun bicake ki ker pa jo Babilon. Ginanyuta magi onyutu kit ma jo ma unu dok gidiyo dano piny bitur kwede.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Daniel ki lureme <char style="ior"><ref loc="DAN 1:1-6:28">1:1—6:28</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Daniel oneno ginanyuta mapatpat <char style="ior"><ref loc="DAN 7:1-12:13">7:1—12:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">a. Daniel oneno lee angwen <char style="ior"><ref loc="DAN 7:1-28">7:1-28</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">b. Daniel oneno nyok romo ki twon nyok dyel <char style="ior"><ref loc="DAN 8:1-9:27">8:1—9:27</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">c. Lakwena ma oa ki i polo <char style="ior"><ref loc="DAN 10:1-11:45">10:1—11:45</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">d. Kare me agiki <char style="ior"><ref loc="DAN 12:1-13">12:1-13</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DAN 1" />
  <para style="ms">Pwonye pa Daniel ki pa lureme</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="DAN 1:1-6:28">1:1—6:28</ref></para>
  <para style="s1">Awobe magi i kal pa Nebukadnejar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 24:1">2 Luk 24:1</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:5-7">2 Tek 36:5-7</ref></char>
    </note>I mwaka me adeke me loc pa Yekoyakim rwot me Juda, Nebukadnejar rwot me Babilon obino i Jerucalem ci olwenyo ikome, ka orumu taun madit meno ci ocego woko liking. <verse eid="DAN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 1:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 20:17-18">2 Luk 20:17-18</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:10-16">24:10-16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:10">2 Tek 36:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 39:7-8">Ica 39:7-8</ref></char></note>Rwot Lubanga omiyo Yekoyakim rwot me Juda i cinge, ci Nebukadnejar okwanyo jami mogo ma kitiyo kwedgi i Ot pa Lubanga, oterogi woko i lobo Cinar, ci oketogi i ot pa lubangane, ka dok oketo jami mukene i ot kano lim pa lubangane.<verse eid="DAN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 1:3" />Ci rwot Nebukadnejar ociko Acipenaj ma en ladit maloyo jo ma kikologi, me yero dano mogo ki ikin jo Icrael, jo ma gin lutino ker kacel ki lutino pa jo ma gin luye, <verse eid="DAN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 1:4" />awobe ma komgi pe kimwonyo, jo mabeco ma gupwonye ikit ryeko ducu, dok ma gikwiri, ki jo matye ki ngec ma oromo, ma gitwero tic i gangkal pa rwot, ki me pwonyogi ki nukuta ki leb pa jo Kaldaya. <verse eid="DAN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 1:5" />Rwot omiyogi ni gucam cam mabeco nino ducu, kit cam ma rwot camoni, ki mato kongo bwino ma rwot matoni. Gin omyero kipwonyogi pi mwaka adek; ci i agiki mwaka meno ka dong kikelgi gudok lutic pa rwot.<verse eid="DAN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 1:6" />Ci ikin jo magi onongo tye iye Daniel, Anania, Micael, ki Ajaria ma gin ducu dano me kaka pa Juda. <verse eid="DAN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 1:7" />Dong ladit maloyo jo ma kikolo ocako nyinggi kit man: Daniel olwongo ni Beltecajar, Anania en olwongo ni Cadrak, Micael olwongo ni Mecak, ki Ajaria dong en olwongo ni Abednego.<verse eid="DAN 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 1:8" />Ento Daniel omoko tame pe me camo gin me kwer ki ikom cam mabeco pa rwoti, kadi ki me balo kome ki kongo bwino ma rwot matoni; pimeno en openyo Acipenaj ni oye tameni wek pe ebal kome kekene. <verse eid="DAN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 1:9" />Ci Lubanga omiyo Acipenaj obedo ki kica ikom Daniel. <verse eid="DAN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 1:10" />Ento Acipenaj owaco ki Daniel ni, “Alworo rwoda ma en rwot, ma oyero cam ma myero wucam ki ginamata ma myero wun wumat; kace oneno ni komi pe yot marom ki kom awobe wadiwu ma mwaka me ditogi bene rom ki megi, ci ibimiyo rwot neka woko.”<verse eid="DAN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 1:11" />Lacen Daniel owaco ki acikari ma onongo Acipenaj oyero me gwoko Daniel, Anania, Micael ki Ajaria ni, <verse eid="DAN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 1:12" />“Kong itemwa pi nino apar ladit, wek kibed kamiyowa cam apura<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cam calo pot dek, ngor, lapena ki muranga. </char></note> aye wacam ki pii amata keken. <verse eid="DAN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 1:13" />Ka wek lacen dong inen komwa ci ipor ki kom awobe ma gicamo cam mabeco ma rwot bene camoni, ka dong itii giri kwedwa kit macalo ibineno ni opore.” <verse eid="DAN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 1:14" />Ci acikarinu owinyo lok meno ma kititeni, ci otemogi kumeno pi nino apar. <verse eid="DAN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 1:15" />I agiki me nino me apar kineno ni komgi leng dok gucwe bene makato awobe mukene ca ma gicamo cam pa rwot mabeconi. <verse eid="DAN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 1:16" />Cutcut acikarinu okwanyo cam mabeco ducu ki kongo bwino ki botgi, ci omiyo cam apura botgi wek gucam.<verse eid="DAN 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 1:17" />Lubanga omiyo ngec mamalo bot awobe magi angwen, ikit kwayi nukuta ducu, omiyo gubedo kwiri ilok ducu ki i ryeko ducu, kun Daniel onongo niang i ginanyuta ki lek bene ducu.<verse eid="DAN 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 1:18" />I agiki me kare meno ma rwot dong ocikoni kikelgi inyime, ci Acipenaj okelogi inyim rwot Nebukadnejar. <verse eid="DAN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 1:19" />Gubino gucung inyim rwot, ci rwot oloko kwedgi; ci ikin gi ducu pe kinongo ngat mo kadi ki acel marom ki Daniel, Anania, Micael ki Ajaria. <verse eid="DAN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 1:20" />Jo magi gidok ikwayi lok ducu ma rwot openyogi kwede, ci onongo ni gikato lutyet ki lukor tipu ducu matye ite kere tyen apar kulu. <verse eid="DAN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 1:21" />Ci Daniel omede ki bedo kunu nio wa i mwaka mukwongo me loc pa Ciro.<verse eid="DAN 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DAN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Lek pa Nebukadnejar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 2:1" />I mwaka me aryo me loc pa rwot Nebukadnejar, Nebukadnejar oleko lek; ci leke obedo kayelo cwinye mada ma nino bene pe mako wange. <verse eid="DAN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:8">Aca 41:8</ref></char></note>Ci rwot ociko ni kilwong lutyet, lukor tipu ducu ki lutal ducu kacel ki jo Kaldaya kagonyo te leke. Ci gubino gudonyo i ot gucung inyim rwot. <verse eid="DAN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 2:3" />Ci rwot ocako waco botgi ni, “Aleko lek, ento cwinya obedo kayela mada ma amito ni ange te leke.”<verse eid="DAN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 2:4" />Cutcut jo Kaldaya guwaco ki rwot ni, “In rwot bed kwo nakanaka! Dong itit lek meno botwa wan lutici ci wabigonyo tere boti.”<verse eid="DAN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 2:5" />Ento rwot odok iye bot jo Kaldaya ni, “Lok ma aloko bedo me ada. Kace pe wumiyo angeyo lek man, kacel ki tyen loke, ci kibingidowu woko matinotino, dok bene kibimuku odiwu woko ducu doko wi obur. <verse eid="DAN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 2:6" />Ento ka wumiyo angeyo lek man kacel ki tyen loke, ci wubigamo mot ki pwoc ki bota kun wulimo bene woro madwong. Pimeno myero wunyuta lek man ki tyen loke.”<verse eid="DAN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 2:7" />Gudok iye tyen me aryone ni, “Wek rwot kong onyut botwa leke wan lutice, ci wabinyutu tyen lok me leke bene.”<verse eid="DAN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 2:8" />Ci rwot ogamo ni, “Angeyo adada ma pe akalo akala ni wun wumito medo kare ameda, pien wungeyo atir ni lok ma aloko bedo me ada. <verse eid="DAN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 2:9" />Ka pe wumiyo angeyo lek man, tye mere cik acel keken ma makowu. Wun dong wutyeko ye me loko bota lok goba ma nyayo tim me bal keken nio wang ma kare oloke. Pimeno wutita lek man, ci miyo abingeyo ni wun kara wutwero nyuta tyen lok me leke.”<verse eid="DAN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 2:10" />Jo Kaldaya gudok iye ki rwot ni, “Pe tye dano mo kadi ki acel i lobo matwero tucu gin ma rwot mito ngeyoni; dok bene pe tye rwot mo madit nyo matek tutwal ma openyo lutyet, lukor tipu nyo jo Kaldaya mo ki kit peny macalo meno. <verse eid="DAN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 2:11" />Lok ma in rwot ipenyoni loke tek, pe tye ngat mo matwero nyutu boti in rwot kono lubangagu ma kabedogi pat ki pa dano.”<verse eid="DAN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 2:12" />Lok man omiyo kiniga omako rwot, odoko ger marac; cutcut ociko ni kinek co maryek ma gibedo i Babilon woko liweng. <verse eid="DAN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 2:13" />Ci kitito pi cik man oromo i lobo ducu ni myero kinek co maryek woko, ci guyenyo Daniel ki lureme bene wek kinekgi woko.<verse eid="DAN 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lubanga onyutu te lek meno bot Daniel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 2:14" />Lacen Daniel oloko lok ki ryeko ki tam maber bot Ariok, ma onongo en aye ladit maloyo acikari ma gin lunek, ma dong onongo okato woko me cito kaneko luryeko ma i Babilon. <verse eid="DAN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 2:15" />Daniel openyo Ariok ni, “Pingo cik pa rwot bedo magwa kit man?” Ci Ariok otito lok meno bot Daniel.<verse eid="DAN 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 2:16" />Lacen Daniel ocito odonyo bot rwot olege me miye kare mo wek enyut telok me lek meno bot rwot.<verse eid="DAN 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 2:17" />Ci Daniel odok cen i ode ci ocako tito loke bot luwote Anania, Micael ki Ajaria. <verse eid="DAN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 2:18" />En otito botgi ni guleg kica ki bot Lubanga me polo mamako lok me mung man, wek en Daniel ki luwote bene pe kinekgi woko kacel ki luryeko mukene me Babilon. <verse eid="DAN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 2:19" />Ki i dyewor meno Lubanga onyutu lok me mung man bot Daniel. Ma omiyo Daniel opwoyo Lubanga me polo mada kun waco ni,<verse eid="DAN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 2:20" />“Kipwo Lubanga ki nyinge bene nakanaka, pien ryeko ki tek tye bote.<verse eid="DAN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 2:21" />En aye ma loko cawa ki kare me cwir nyo me oro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:21">en aye ma kwanyo luker woko ki i kergi ci keto luker manyen me leyo katyen gi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:21">en miyo ryeko bot jo maryek</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:21">dok miyo ngec bot jo matwero niang maber.<verse eid="DAN 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 2:22" />En nyutu gin matye kamatut</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:22">ki gin mukane i mung en nyutu woko kamaleng;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:22">dok ngeyo gin matye i colpiny, ki dero bene bedo bote.<verse eid="DAN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 2:23" />Ai Lubanga pa kwariwa, amiyo pwoc ki pak boti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:23">pien in aye ma imiya ryeko ki kero, dok kombedi dong imiyo wangeyo gin</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:23">ma onongo wapenyo pire boti, pien dong imiyo wangeyo lok pa rwot.”<verse eid="DAN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daniel otucu lek pa rwot ka ogonyo tere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 2:24" />Lacen Daniel ocito bot Ariok, ma en dano ma rwot oyero ni onek luryeko me Babilon otyek woko ducuni; ci owaco bote ni, “Pe inek luryeko me Babilon ityekgi woko; tera i ot inyim rwot, ci abinyutu bot rwot telok me leke.”<verse eid="DAN 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 2:25" />Ariok orune oyotoyot ki myelkom otero Daniel i ot inyim rwot, ci owaco bot rwot ni, “Anongo dano mo ki ikin opii ma kikelogi ki i Juda matwero gonyo telok me lekini.”<verse eid="DAN 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 2:26" />Ci rwot openyo Daniel (ma onongo kilwongo bene ni Beltecajar) ni, “Itwero nyuta gin ma aneno i lek, dok itwero gonyo telok me leka meno?”<verse eid="DAN 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 2:27" />Ci Daniel odok iye ki rwot ni, “Pe tye luryeko mo, lukor tipu, nyo lutyet, kadi wa jo ma gingiyo lok kom lakalatwe ma gitwero nyutu kit mung mukane macalo man bot rwot ma onongo rwot openyo pireni. <verse eid="DAN 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 2:28" />Ento tye Lubanga mo i polo ma nyutu kit mung ducu ma okane, en aye ma omiyo rwot ongeyo lok ducu ma bitime ikare ma pud tye anyim. Dong lek ma ilekoni ki ginanyuta ma obino iwii ikare ma ibutu piny iwi kitanda gin ene: <verse eid="DAN 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 2:29" />Ikare ma ibutu iwi kitanda, ai rwot, tam obino iwii ma nyuti gin ma bitime ikare me anyim, dong en ngat ma yabo mung ducu ma okane woko kamalengi, onyutu boti omiyo ingeyo gin ma bitime. <verse eid="DAN 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 2:30" />Ento ki tung bota kinyuta mung man ma okane, pe tyen loke ni an aryek akato gin makwo ducu, ento wek agony telok me lek man wek in rwot inge, ki dok bene wek inge tam matye i cwinyi.<verse eid="DAN 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 2:31" />Ai rwot, yam ineno cal mo ma kitiyo ki cing. Cal man dit dok ryeny matek ma okato kare. Ocung inyimi; dok kit manen kwede miyo lworo mako dano. <verse eid="DAN 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 2:32" />Wi cal man kitiyo ki jabu ma kiliyo maber adada, kore ki bade ducu kitiyo ki ryal, ki dong iye ki eme kitiyo ki mola. <verse eid="DAN 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 2:33" />Oloto tyene kitiyo ki nyonyo, ki tyene ma kicibo kwede piny kitiyo dule mogo ki nyonyo kamukene kicweyo ki lobo. <verse eid="DAN 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 2:34" />Ikare ma ineno, got obar ci otyer woko kekene ma pe dano aye otyero ki cinge, ci cutcut ocelo cal meno woko ityene kama kitiyo ki nyonyo ki ma kicweyo ki lobo, ci ongidogi woko matinotino. <verse eid="DAN 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 2:35" />Meno omiyo nyonyo, lobo, mola, ryal ki jabu ducu gunginye woko matinotino, ci gudoko calo cungkal ma i laro moyo me oro, ci yamo dong otingogi oterogi woko, ma pe dok kitwero yenyo yoogi kinongo. Ento got meno ma ocelo cali, oloke odoko twon got madit mada ma opongo lobo woko ducu.<verse eid="DAN 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 2:36" />Meno aye leke; kombedi dong abigonyo te lek boti in rwot. <verse eid="DAN 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 2:37" />Dong in rwot, in aye rwot maloyo luker ducu, dok Lubanga me polo aye ma omiyo icamo ker, en ma omiyi twero ki tek, wa ki deyo bene, <verse eid="DAN 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DAN 2:38" />dok en omiyi twero me loyo dano, lee tim ki winyi me polo ducu, wa ki kama gibedo iye ducu. In aye iwic me jabuni. <verse eid="DAN 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DAN 2:39" />Lacen inge loci, ker mo matidi tutwal bicake, ma rwote tidi dok in iloye ki dit, ka lacen bibedo ker me adek me mola, ma biloyo lobo ducu. <verse eid="DAN 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DAN 2:40" />Ka dok ker me angwene bicake ma bibedo matek calo nyonyo, pien nyonyo turu jami ducu, dok ngidogi woko matinotino, ci tyekogi woko liweng; kit macalo nyonyo nginyo kwede jami, en bene bituru ci nginyo ker mukwongo woko ducu. <verse eid="DAN 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DAN 2:41" />Kit macalo ibedo kaneno dule, tyene ki lwete mogo kiyubu ki lobo pa lacwe agulu, ki dule mogo kiyubu ki nyonyo, meno nyutu ker ma opoke; ento nyonyo mogo mamiyo cung matek bibedo ikine, kit macalo ineno nyonyo ma orube ki lobo dabani. <verse eid="DAN 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DAN 2:42" />Kit macalo lwet tyene dule mukene kiyubu ki nyonyo ki mukene kiyubu ki lobo, kitmeno bene ker man bibedo matek ikare mogo ki dok bibedo goro adada ci tur woko ikare mukene. <verse eid="DAN 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DAN 2:43" />Kit macalo ineno nyonyo orube woko ki lobo dabani, kibirube woko bene kitmeno kun ginyome ikin gi keken gi, ento bedo maber kacel pe bibedo tye ikin gi, kit macalo nyonyo bene pe rube ki loboni. <verse eid="DAN 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DAN 2:44" />Dok ikare pa luker meno Lubanga me polo biketo ker mukene ma rii nakanaka ma pe kitwero balone, kadi dit me loce bene pe kibiweko i cing rok mukene. Ker meno manyeni bituru ker magi ducu ngidogi woko matinotino, ci tyekogi woko ducu, en aye dong bicung bedo matwal, <verse eid="DAN 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DAN 2:45" />kit macalo ineno maca obar otyer woko ki ikom got madit ma pe dano aye otyero ki cinge, ci oturu nyonyo, mola, lobo, ryal ki jabu ongidogi woko ducu matinotino. Lubanga madit dong otyeko nyutu bot rwot gin ma bitime ikare me anyim. Leke obedo ada ki te loke bene tye atir.”<verse eid="DAN 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nebukadnejar omiyo mot bot Daniel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="DAN 2:46" />Cutcut rwot Nebukadnejar oryebe piny, omiyo woro bot Daniel, ka dong ociko ni myero kikel gityer ki odok eceta wek kityer bot Daniel. <verse eid="DAN 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DAN 2:47" />Ci rwot owaco bot Daniel ni, “Ada, Lubangani aye Lubanga maloyo lwak lubanga mukene ducu, dok en bene Rwot maloyo luker ducu, en ngat ma nyutu mung ducu ma okane woko kamaleng, pien in bene ibedo ki twer me nyutu mung man ma okaneni.” <verse eid="DAN 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DAN 2:48" />Lacen rwot omiyo deyo mamalo ki mot madwong bot Daniel, ka okete me bedo laloc i lobo ducu me Babilon, dok bene me bedo ladit maloyo luryeko ducu matye i Babilon. <verse eid="DAN 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DAN 2:49" />Daniel olego rwot, ci rwot bene oye legane omiyo en oyero Cadrak, Mecak ki Abednego, oketogi me bedo ludito maloyo lwak ki neno lok ducu ma time i lobo Babilon. Ento Daniel obedo mere i gangkal pa rwot.<verse eid="DAN 2:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DAN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Nebukadnejar ociko ni Kiwor Cal me Jabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 3:1" />Rwot Nebukadnejar oyubu cal lubanga ki jabu; ma bore obedo puti pyere abongwen ki lace puti abongwen ci ocibo ocung i bar me Dura, i lobo Babilon. <verse eid="DAN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 3:2" />Cutcut rwot Nebukadnejar ocwalo lok me lwongo luloyo madongo, ludito pa lwak, ki luloc me dul lobo mapatpat, lumiitam, lugwoklim, lungolkop madito ki matino, ki ludito ducu me dul lobo mapatpat, ci gubin kakwero cal lubanga ma rwot Nebukadnejar oyubu ocibo ocung likungi. <verse eid="DAN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 3:3" />Ikare ma ludito magi ducu gucoke kacel kakwero cal lubanga ma rwot Nebukadnejar oyubu ci ocibo ocung likungi; ci gin ducu gucung inyim cal lubanga ma Nebukadnejar ociboni. <verse eid="DAN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 3:4" />Ci kicwalo kwena ki lok ma winye malongo bot lwak ducu ni, “Wun lwak me lobo ducu, ki rok ducu mapatpat, kicikowu ducu ni <verse eid="DAN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 3:5" />ka wuwinyo bila onyo obute okok, olwet ma kikutu, opuk, adungu, nanga ki nyamulere ducu, ki kit wer ducu ma kigoyo, myero wun ducu wuryebe piny wuwor cal lubanga man me jabu ma rwot Nebukadnejar oyubu ci ocibo ocung likungi. <verse eid="DAN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 3:6" />Dong ngat mo ma pe biryebe piny kaworo cal lubanga man, kibimake woko oyotoyot ka kibibole i rukmac mukur malyeti.” <verse eid="DAN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 3:7" />Pimeno, ikare ma lwak me rok ducu guwinyo koko bila, koko nyamulere, ki koko opuk, ki adungu, nanga, obute, ki kit wer ducu mapatpat ma kigoyo agoya, ci lwak me lobo mapol, rok ducu mapatpat, ki jo ma loko leb mapatpat ducu guryebe piny guworo cal lubanga me jabu ma rwot Nebukadnejar oyubu ci ocibo ocung likungi.<verse eid="DAN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kidoto lurem Daniel adeki ni gubedo lujemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 3:8" />Ikare meno jo Kaldaya mogo ma onongo gitye ki tam maracu gudyere kamaleng, gucako doto Lujudaya. <verse eid="DAN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 3:9" />Guwaco bot Nebukadnejar ni, “In rwot myero ibed kwo nakanaka! <verse eid="DAN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 3:10" />In rwot, onongo dong ityeko keto cik ni, ka dano ducu guwinyo koko bila, koko nyamulere, ki koko opuk, ki adungu, nanga, obute, ki kit wer ducu mapatpat ma kigoyo agoya, ci guryebe piny kaworo cal lubanga me jabu; <verse eid="DAN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 3:11" />dong ka dano mo pe biryebe piny kaworone, kibimake woko oyot kibole woko i rukmac mukur malyeti. <verse eid="DAN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 3:12" />Ento tye Lujudaya magi, Cadrak, Mecak ki Abednego ma iyerogi iketogi me bedo ludito maloyo lwak dok maneno lok ducu ma time i lobo Babilon. Ai rwot, jo magi adeki pe gulubu ciki wa ki acel. Pe guworo lubangani, dok bene pe guworo cal lubanga me jabu ma itiyo ci icibo ocung likungi.”<verse eid="DAN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 3:13" />Cutcut kiniga omako Nebukadnejar woko, omiyo cik ki kiniga ni myero kicit kikel Cadrak, Mecak ki Abednego kong bote. Ci kicito kikelo jo magi adeki inyim rwot. <verse eid="DAN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 3:14" />Ci cutcut Nebukadnejar openyogi ni, “Lok ma kititani mono ada, ni wun Cadrak, Mecak ki Abednego, pe wuworo lubangana, dok bene pe wuworo cal lubanga me jabu ma an aye ayubu ci acibo ocung likungi? <verse eid="DAN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 3:15" />Kace kombedi dong wuwinyo koko bila, ki koko nyamulere, ki koko opuk, ki adungu, nanga, obute ki kit wer mapatpat ma kigoyogi agoya, ka wuyube dok wuye me ryebe piny kaworo cal lubanga man ma an aye ayubuni, ci nongo ber adada; ento kace pe wuworo, ci kibimakowu oyotoyot labongo gale, kibolowu woko i rukmac mukur malyeti; ci lubanga mene ma bilarowu kwanyowu woko ki i cingani?”<verse eid="DAN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 3:16" />Pimeno, Cadrak, Mecak ki Abednego gugamo lok gudok iye ki rwot ni, “Ai Nebukadnejar, pe wamito walok boti gin mo pi lok man. <verse eid="DAN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 3:17" />Ka lok dong tye kumeno, ci Lubangawa ma waworoni bitwero larowa ki i rukmac mukur malyeti; dok en bene bilarowa kwanyowa woko ki i cingi, in rwot. <verse eid="DAN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 3:18" />Ento kace pe, myero in rwot inge maber ni, wan pe wabiworo lubangani dok pe wabiworo cal lubanga me jabu ma iyubu ci icibo ocung likungi.”<verse eid="DAN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kingolo kop me to ikom lurem Daniel adeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 3:19" />Cutcut akemo mager omako Nebukadnejar woko, omiyo wange bene oloke woko mapat ikom Cadrak, Mecak ki Abednego. Ci oyotoyot ociko ni kimed mac olyeti tyen abiro kulu makato kit ma onongo lyet kwede wi atii ca. <verse eid="DAN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 3:20" />Ka dong ociko jo mogo ma gin twoni oteka ma gitye i dul monye ni gutwe Cadrak, Mecak ki Abednego woko, ci gubolgi i rukmac ma okur malyeti. <verse eid="DAN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 3:21" />Ci gutweyo jo meno woko ma onongo gitye ki ginaruka magi ikomgi, jor, kanyi, tok me wigi, ki bongigi mukene ducu, ci kibologi kwede woko ducu i rukmac ma okur malyeti. <verse eid="DAN 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 3:22" />Cik pa rwot onongo obedo gwa matek, ki rukmac bene onongo dong odoko lyet matek, ma leb mace ma lyel bene oneko jo meno ma gutero Cadrak, Mecak ki Abednego kabologi woko i maci. <verse eid="DAN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 3:23" />Jo magi adeki, Cadrak, Mecak ki Abednego, kibologi gupoto wa idye rukmac ma dong kitweyogi woko gulugulu.<verse eid="DAN 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 3:24" />Lacen rwot Nebukadnejar obedo ki ur madit omiyo oa malo oyotoyot, ci openyo lumiitame ni, “Wan pe wabolo jo adek i mac ma onongo dong kitweyogi woko?” Gudoke iye ni, “Ada, rwot, iloko kakare.” <verse eid="DAN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 3:25" />Ci rwot dok ogamo kun waco ni, “Ento kombedi atye kaneno jo angwen ma pe kitweyogi gitye kawot awota idye mac, kun mac bene pe wangogi; dok aneno dano me angweneni nen calo lubanga mo.” <figure style="fig" alt="Nebuchadnezzar saw four people in the furnace" file="CO01362B.TIF" size="col" loc="Dan 3:25" copy="David Cook" ref="3:25">Nebukadneja oneno dano angwen idye mac</figure><verse eid="DAN 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kigonyo co adeki ci kimedo rwomgi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 3:26" />Ci Nebukadnejar obino onyiko cok ki dogola me kabedo kama rukmac tye kalyel iyeni, ci owaco ni, “Cadrak, Mecak ki Abednego, wun lutic pa Lubanga Mamalo Twal, wukat woko, wubin kany!” Cutcut Cadrak, Mecak ki Abednego gukati woko ki i mac. <verse eid="DAN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 3:27" />Ci luloyo madongo, ki ludito pa lwak, ki luloc me dul lobo mapatpat kacel ki lumiitam pa rwot gucoke kacel, ci guneno ni mac pe owango jo meno; yer wigi mo ma mac oroyo pe tye, ginarukagi bene mac pe ogudu, dok ngwec mac bene obedo peke ikomgi.<verse eid="DAN 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 3:28" />Ma omiyo Nebukadnejar otugi waco ni, “Kipwo Lubanga pa Cadrak, Mecak ki Abednego ma ocwalo lamalaika ci olaro lutice woko, ma gigeno en, ma gukwero lubu cika an rwot woko, gudyero kwogi me to ma kaworo lubanga mo ata ma pe Lubangagi kikome.<verse eid="DAN 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 3:29" />Pimeno dong aketo cik kombedi ni, ‘Lwak me lobo ducu nyo rok ducu mapatpat, nyo leb mo ma biloko lok mo marac ikom Lubanga pa Cadrak, Mecak ki Abednego kibingidogi woko matinotino, ki odigi bene kibimuku woko dong obur; pien dong pe tye lubanga mo mukene matwero laro dano kit man.’”<verse eid="DAN 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 3:30" />Ma omiyo rwot ocako medo rwom me tic pa Cadrak, Mecak ki Abednego i lobo Babilon.<verse eid="DAN 3:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DAN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Nebukadnejar oleko lek me aryone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 4:1" />Rwot Nebukadnejar ocoyo lok man bot lwake, lwak me rok ducu mapatpat, ki jo ma loko leb mapatpat ma gibedo iwi lobo ducu: awaco botwu ni,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 4:1">“Kuc omede madwong botwu! <verse eid="DAN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 4:2" />Onongo aneno ni ber ki tung bota ka atito lanyut mogo ki tango mogo ma Lubanga Mamalo Twal otyeko tiyo ikoma.<verse eid="DAN 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 4:3" />Lanyut ducu ma en onyutu tye ada dok dit ma pe wace,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 4:3">ki tango ma en tiyo dongo mada!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 4:3">Kere en aye ker ma rii nakanaka, ki loce bene bedo ikare pa yalwak ducu.<verse eid="DAN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 4:4" />An Nebukadnejar onongo yam abedo mot i oda ma piny okwe, dok abedo ki gum me nongo lonyo madwong i gangkal ma mera. <verse eid="DAN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 4:5" />I dyewor acel aleko lek ma omiya lworo marac; dok ginanyuta mogo obino iwiya omiyo koma opo woko lirikrik. <verse eid="DAN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 4:6" />Pimeno omiyo aketo cik ma waco ni myero kikel luryeko ducu ma i Babilon inyima, wek gumiya ange tyen lok me lek ma alekoni. <verse eid="DAN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 4:7" />Cutcut lutyet ki lukor tipu, Lukaldaya ki jo matyeto lok kom lakalatwe gubino gudonyo bota; ci atito botgi lek ma alekoni, ento pe gutwero gonya te leke. <verse eid="DAN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 4:8" />Lacen i agikine Daniel obino odonyo ocung inyima, (en ngat ma nyinge mukene kilwongo ni Beltecajar, macalo nying lubangana), en dano ma cwiny pa lubanga maleng bedo i iye, ci atito bote lek ma aleko kun awace ni, <verse eid="DAN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 4:9" />‘In Beltecajar, ladit maloyo lutyet ducu, dong atyeko ngeyo ni cwiny pa lubanga maleng bedo i ii, dok aniang ni pe tye mung mo mukane ma nyutune woko kamaleng tek ki boti. Lek ma onongo alekoni en ene; gonya te loke.<verse eid="DAN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 4:10" />Ginanyuta ma obino iwiya ikare ma abutu en ene: nen, aneno yat mo ma ocung idye lobo; maber mukato kare woko. <verse eid="DAN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 4:11" />Yat meno odongo ci odoko tek, ki wiye bene ogudu polo, dok onongo nen woko liweng ki i agiki lobo ducu. <verse eid="DAN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 4:12" />Pote ducu onongo nen mabeco, ki nyige bene onongo pol mada, obedo cam mayam gin makwo ducu camo. Lee ducu me tim giywe ite tipune, ki winyo me polo bene gibedo i jange ducu, dong gin makwo ducu gikwo pi camo nyige.<verse eid="DAN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 4:13" />Ikare ma abedo katamo pi ginanyuta ca, ci aneno lamalaika ma lakurpiny mo maleng, ma olor piny oa ki i polo.’ <verse eid="DAN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 4:14" />Ci en odange matek kun waco ni, ‘Tong yat meno iret woko piny, ci itong jange bene woko ducu, ka ilwer pote woko ducu, dok iket nyige woko atata; wek lee gua ki i tere guring woko, ki winyi bene gua woko ki i jange. <verse eid="DAN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 4:15" />Ento myero iwek ajute ki lwite ma ocung i ngomi, ci itwe ajute woko ki rubota nyonyo, ki mola, obed idye lum alita i tim.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 4:15">Wek toyo ma a ki i polo odyak kome woko, dok wek obed ikin lee ki ginapita ma gibedo i lum. <verse eid="DAN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 4:16" />Wek kilok tame woko ki i tam pa dano, ci kimiye obed ki tam pa lee; wek orii mwaka abiro. <verse eid="DAN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 4:17" />Lumalaika ma gin lukurpiny aye gumoko lok man, kun gulubu lok pa jo maleng, wek i agikine omii gin makwo ducu gunge ni, Ngat Mamalo Twal aye maloyo ker pa dano, dok tye ki twero me miyone bene bot ngat ma en mito, kun keto kadi wa dano ma rwomgi piny adada me loyo lwak.’<verse eid="DAN 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 4:18" />Man aye lek ma an rwot Nebukadnejar aneno. Dong kombedi in Beltecajar, myero ituc telok me lek man, pien luryeko ducu ma gitye ite kera pe gutwero gonyo te lek man bota, ento in itwero, pien cwiny pa lubanga maleng bedo i ii.”<verse eid="DAN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daniel ogonyo te lek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 4:19" />Daniel ma nyinge mukene Beltecajar kong dok cwinye obale woko pi cawa mo manok, ki tame ducu opoyo tipu kome woko. Ci rwot owace ni, “Beltecajar, pe iwek lek man nyo gonyo tere opo tipu komi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 4:19">Beltecajar odoke iye ni, “Rwoda, onongo bedo ber ka lek man tye pi jo ma gidagi, ki ka onongo te leke bene obed pi lukwori! <verse eid="DAN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 4:20" />Yat ma onongo ineno ma odongo odoko matek, ma wiye ogudu polo, ma onongo nen wa ki i agiki lobo ducuni, <verse eid="DAN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 4:21" />ma pote ducu onongo nen mabeco ki nyige bene onongo pol mada, dok obedo cam ma gin makwo ducu camo, ma lee ducu me tim giywe ite tipune, ki winyo me polo bene gibedo i jange ducu, <verse eid="DAN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 4:22" />en aye in rwot ma dong idongo idoko tek. Diti bene dong odongo oo wa i polo, ki loci bene oyare oo wa i agiki lobo. <verse eid="DAN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 4:23" />Ikare ma in rwot itye kaneno, ci lamalaika ma lakurpiny, oa ki i polo kun lor piny ci owaco ni, ‘Tong yat meno iret woko piny, ibal woko, ento wek ajute ki lwite ma ocung i ngomi, ci itwe ajute woko ki rubota nyonyo, ki mola, wek obed idye lum alita i tim. Wek toyo ma a ki i pol odyak kom laco man, ma yat man ocung pireni, dok wek obed mere ikin lee ma gibedo i lum i lobo, nio wang ma mwaka abiro okato.’<verse eid="DAN 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 4:24" />Man aye telok me leke, ai rwot: Man aye cik pa Ngat Mamalo Twal, ma obino ikom rwoda rwot, <verse eid="DAN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 4:25" />man nyutu ni kibiryemi woko ki ikin dano, dok ibibedo kacel ki lee me tim; kibimiyo icamo lum calo twon, dok toyo ma a ki i polo bene bidyako komi woko, ci ibirii mwaka abiro, nio wang ma ingeyo ni Ngat Mamalo Twal aye loyo ker pa dano, dok en tye ki twero me miyone bot ngat mo keken ma en mito. <verse eid="DAN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 4:26" />Kit macalo onongo kiciko ni kiwek ajut yat ki lwite, ada ker bibedo meri matwal nicake ikare ma in ibingeyo ni Lubanga aye laloc. <verse eid="DAN 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 4:27" />Pimeno in rwot, myero iye tamani; wek ingut iwek bali woko ducu ci icak bedo ki kwo ma atir, kun iweko bali ki bedo ki kica bot jo ma kiunugi, wek kare me loci ibimede ki bedo ki kuc ki yweyo ma oromo.”<verse eid="DAN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 4:28" />Lok magi ducu otime ikom rwot Nebukadnejar. <verse eid="DAN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 4:29" />Inge dwe apar wiye aryo ma rwot onongo tye kawot iwi ot me gangkal me Babilon, <verse eid="DAN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 4:30" />ci en rwot owaco ni, “Nen kit ma Babilon dit kwede, ma an kikoma aye agero ki tek me twerona wek obed gangkal manyutu tekona, ki deyo me dita!”<verse eid="DAN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 4:31" />Ikare ma rwot pud tye kalok, ci dwon oa ki i polo ma waco ni, “Ai rwot Nebukadnejar an aye awaco boti ni: ker dong kikwanyo woko ki boti. <verse eid="DAN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 4:32" />Dok dong kibiryemi woko ki ikin dano, ci ibibedo kacel ki lee tim; kibimiyo icamo lum macalo twon pi mwaka abiro, nio wang ma ipwonye ni Ngat Mamalo Twal aye maloyo ker pa dano, dok tye ki twero me miyone bene bot ngat mo keken ma en mito.”<verse eid="DAN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 4:33" />Oyotoyot lok man ocobe kakare ikom Nebukadnejar. Ci cutcut kiryeme woko ki ikin dano, ocako camo lum calo twon, ki toyo ma a ki i polo bene odyako kome woko nio ka yer kome ducu olot maboco macalo yec kom ocur, ki lwete bene olot maboco calo lwet winyo.<verse eid="DAN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nebukadnejar opako Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 4:34" />I agiki me kare meno ducu, an Nebukadnejar, ailo wanga aneno polo, ci tipu koma ocako dwogo, omiyo apwoyo En Ngat Mamalo Twal mada, ka dok apake kun aketo deyo ikom en ma bedo kwo nakanakani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 4:34">Loce bedo matwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 4:34">ki kere bene bedo ikare pa yalwak ducu;<verse eid="DAN 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 4:35" />jo ducu ma bedo i lobo bene gin pe gin mo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 4:35">en tiyo gin ma cwinye mito i mony me polo ki ikin jo ma bedo i lobo bene;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 4:35">ngat mo peke matwero juke, nyo matwero wace ni, “Itimo ango?”<verse eid="DAN 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 4:36" />Ikare meno kikome bene en aye tipu koma ocako dwogo kwede ki deyo me kera, ki dita ki bera ducu odwogo ikoma. Lumiitam ki luditona me awora guyenya, ci gudwoka dok i kera, ki dit mukene makato dok kimedo bota. <verse eid="DAN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 4:37" />Ma omiyo kombedi an, Nebukadnejar, apako, adworo dok aworo Rwot me polo; pien tice ducu tye atir, ki kwo me bedone ducu tye atir; jo ma luwake en twero kwanyogi ci dwoko rwomgi woko piny.<verse eid="DAN 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DAN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Belcajar otedo karama madit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 5:1" />Rwot Belcajar otedo karama madit pi luditone me awora ma welgi romo alip acel, ci en omato kongo bwino kacel kwedgi.<verse eid="DAN 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 5:2" />Ikare ma dong kongo okato woko iwiye, Belcajar omiyo cik ni kikel kikopo jabu ki me ryal ducu mayam wone Nebukadnejar ocokogi woko ki i Ot pa Lubanga matye i Jerucalem, wek en rwot ki luditone me awora, kacel ki mone ki mon angecane ducu gutii kwede me mato kongo. <verse eid="DAN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 5:3" />Ci kikelo jami magi me ryal ki me jabu mayam kiyakogi ki i Ot pa Lubanga matye i Jerucalem; ci rwot ki lwak luditone me awora, ki mone, ki mon angecane gumato kwede. <verse eid="DAN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 5:4" />Gumato kongo bwino, kun gipako lwak lubangagu me jabu ki me ryal, me mola, me nyonyo, me yat ki me got.<verse eid="DAN 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 5:5" />Cutcut kineno cing dano ka tye kacoyo coc i kor ot ma i gangkal pa rwot, ma okeme ki lacib mac; ci rwot oneno ka cing dano tye ka coc. <verse eid="DAN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 5:6" />Man omiyo wang rwot oloke woko ki tame bene obale woko ci omiyo cwinye opoto niling; pyere otonge woko, ki conge aryo ducu gubedo kagone kacel. <verse eid="DAN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 5:7" />Omiyo rwot okok ki dwon malongo ni kikel lukor tipu ki jo Kaldaya ki jo ma gingiyo lok kom lakalatwe. Rwot owaco bot luryeko ducu ma i Babilon ni, “Ngat mo ma bikwano coc man, ki gonya te loke, kibiruku ki bongo ma obedo lamarlamar, kibirwako nyor me jabu bene i ngute, ci dok bibedo laloc me adek ite ker man.” <verse eid="DAN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 5:8" />Ci luryeko pa rwot ducu gubino gudonyo i ot bote, ento pe gutwero kwano coc ma i kor ot kadi ki gonyo te loke bot rwot bene oloyogi. <verse eid="DAN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 5:9" />Man omiyo cwiny rwot Belcajar opoto niling, wa kome ducu obale woko, ci luditone me awora guuru dok gungeng woko ata.<verse eid="DAN 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 5:10" />Ikare ma min rwot Belcajar owinyo lok pa rwot ki pa luditone me awora ducu, obino odonyo i ot kama gitye iye kacamo karama; ci owaco ni, “Ai rwot, bed kwo nakanaka! Pe myero iwek tami omii cwinyi obed kapoto, dok pe iwek komi obale. <verse eid="DAN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 5:11" />Tye dano mo ite keri kany ma cwiny pa lubanga maleng bedo i iye. Ikare pa woru onongo yam ginanyuta me mung ducu ki niang wa ryeko, macalo ryeko pa lubangagu ducu, kinongo ni en tye kwede, ma omiyo woru, rwot Nebukadnejar, oketo en me bedo dano maloyo lutyet, lukor tipu, jo Kaldaya ki luryeko ducu ma ngiyo lok ikom lakalatwe. <verse eid="DAN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 5:12" />Dano man Daniel, yam rwot ocako nyinge ni Beltecajar, onongo tye ki cwiny maber makato, dok onongo bene tye ki ngec wa ki niang ma oromo me gonyo telok me lek ducu, kun gonyo wa telok macalo koc lit woko bene, dok cobo lok me peko mogo ma dano tye kwede. Kombedi myero ilwong Daniel obin, ci en aye bigonyo te coc man.”<verse eid="DAN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daniel ogonyo te lok me coc</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 5:13" />Cutcut kikelo Daniel inyim rwot. Ci rwot ocako lok ki Daniel kun penye ni, “In aye Daniel, ngat acel ikin jo Juda mayam wora omakogi ki i Juda ci okelogi kanyi? <verse eid="DAN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 5:14" />Awinyo lok ikomi ni cwiny pa lubanga maleng tye ikomi, dok bene ni itye ki ryeko me nyutu mung mogo, ki niang wa ki ryeko makato pa jo mukene. <verse eid="DAN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 5:15" />Kombedi onongo kikelo luryeko ki lukor tipu inyima ni gukwan coc man dok gumiya ange te loke; ento pe gutwero nyuta te loke. <verse eid="DAN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 5:16" />Ento onongo awinyo ni itwero gonyo te lok mapol, dok bene icobo lok me peko ma dano tye kwede. Dong kombedi kace itwero kwano coc man ki gonyo te loke wek ange, ci kibiruki ki bongo ma lamarlamar, kibirwako nyor me jabu bene i nguti, dok bene ibibedo laloc me adek ite ker man.”<verse eid="DAN 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 5:17" />Ci Daniel odok iye bot rwot ni, “Gwok moti ducu obed piri giri, dok imii pwoc ma imito miya bot ngat mukene; kadibed pe agamo gin mo ma imiya pud abikwano coc man boti rwot, dok bene abigonyo te loke ingeyo.<verse eid="DAN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 5:18" />Ai rwot, Lubanga ma En Ngat Mamalo Twali yam omiyo woru obedo rwot maloyo lobo, omiye bene dit ki deyo wa ki twero ducu. <verse eid="DAN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 5:19" />Pi dit mayam kimiye, oweko lwak me rok ducu ki rok mapatpat ducu ki jo maloko leb mapatpat komgi omyel dok gubedo ki lworo inyime. Ka yam cwinye omito ni enek dano mo ci neko mere aneka, ka omito ni ewek dano moni obed kwo, ci weko bedo kwo; ka omito ni emii dit bot ngat mo ci miyo, ka omito ni edwok rwom pa dano moni piny ci dwoko bene. <verse eid="DAN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 5:20" />Ento ikare ma dong en ocako kete malo kekene ki i cwinye, omiyo cwinye odoko nwang ci ocako loc ki wake marac, omiyo kikwanye woko ki iwi komkere, wa ki deyone bene kikwanyo woko ki ikome. <verse eid="DAN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 5:21" />Ci kiryeme woko ki ikin dano ki bene kiloko tame odoko macalo tam pa lee tim, ci obedo kacamo lum calo twon, dok toyo ma a ki i polo obedo kadyako kome, nio ka ongeyo ni Lubanga Mamalo Twal aye maloyo ker pa dano, dok en bene aye ma keto ngat mo keken ma cwinye mito me bedo laloc iye.<verse eid="DAN 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 5:22" />Dong in Belcajar, in i wode kikome, ento pe ibedo mwol i cwinyi, kadi bed onongo ingeyo lok man ducu. <verse eid="DAN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 5:23" />Ento ikete malo kekeni ci iete giri ikom Rwot me polo; dok jami mayam kitiyo kwede i ode ducu kikelogi ci kiketogi inyimi, ci in kacel ki ludito me aworani, moni, ki mon angecani ducu wutiyo kwede me mato kongo bwino. Wubedo bene kapako lwak lubanga me jabu, me ryal, me mola, me nyonyo, me yat ki me godi ducu, ma pe gineno piny, pe giwinyo lok, dok ma pe gingeyo gin mo kadi ki acel. Ento in pe ibedo kaworo Lubanga ma omiyo kwo ki yweyo botini, kun en bene aye ma gwoki ikit bedoni ducu.<verse eid="DAN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 5:24" />Dong kicwalo cing dano ki inyime, ci ocoyo coc man.<verse eid="DAN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 5:25" />Coc ma kicoyoni tye kit man: MENE MENE TEKEL PARCIN. <verse eid="DAN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 5:26" />Dong telok man tye kit man: MENE, Lubanga dong otyeko kwano wel nino me keri woko, dok onyutu bene ni agikine dong cok. <verse eid="DAN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 5:27" />TEKEL, dong kipimi i mijan, ci kinongo ni in iyot tutwal; <verse eid="DAN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 5:28" />PEREC, keri kipoko iye woko ci kimiyo bot jo Medi ki bot jo Percia.”<verse eid="DAN 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 5:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 41:42">Aca 41:42</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Cutcut Belcajar omiyo twero, ci kiruku Daniel ki bongo ma lamarlamar, ka kirwako nyor me jabu i ngute, ci gitito lok ikome oromo piny ducu ni en aye dong bibedo laloc me adeke ite ker me Babilon.<verse eid="DAN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 5:30" />I dyewor me nino meno kikome kineko rwot Belcajar woko. <verse eid="DAN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 5:31" />Ci Dario ma jo Medi oleyo ker, ma dong mwaka me dite oromo pyere abicel wiye aryo.<verse eid="DAN 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DAN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Kibolo Daniel i boro pa labwor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 6:1" />Dario omoko tame me keto luloyo madongo miya acel ki pyere aryo me bedo luloc ite kere i kabedo ducu mapatpat. <verse eid="DAN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 6:2" />Ka dok oketo luloc madito adek me loyogi. Ikin gin adeki Daniel onongo bene tye iye, ma luloyo miya acel ki pyere aryoni ducu omyero guter lok ma mako ticgi bot luloc madito adeki, wek lim pa rwot pe olanye ata. <verse eid="DAN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 6:3" />Lacen kinongo ni Daniel dok kwiri mada makato luloc mukene madito aryoni woko, loyo wa rwodi ducu, pien cwiny maber makato onongo tye ikome; dong omiyo rwot obedo ki yub me keto en me loyo lobo ma ite kere ducu. <verse eid="DAN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 6:4" />Ma omiyo luloc madito kacel ki rwodi gubedo kayenyo yo ma myero kinong ki bal ikom Daniel mamako lok me loyo ker; ento gin pe gunongo kacungugi mo me dote kadi ki roc mo, pien Daniel onongo obedo dano ma lagen, ma pe tye ki kit roc mo, dok lok mo me bal bene pe kinongo ikome. <verse eid="DAN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 6:5" />Lacen jo meno guwaco ni, “Pe wabinongo lok me doto Daniel nio ka wayenyo kit lok malube ki cik pa Lubanganeni.”<verse eid="DAN 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 6:6" />Ci luloc madito kacel ki rwodi magi guporo lok kacel ci guye woko lawangacel ka gua gubino bot rwot guwace ni, “Ai rwot Dario, bed kwo nakanaka! <verse eid="DAN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 6:7" />Luloc ducu madito me ker man, kacel ki ludito pa lwak, rwodi, lumiitam ki luloc me dul lobo mapatpat guye lawangacel ni rwot myero omok cik ki omii twero ma pe kitwero lokone. Ci kace kibinongo ngat mo kalego lubanga mo nyo kaworo dano mukene ma pe in rwot, pi nino pyere adek ci dano macalo meno kibibolo woko ikin lwak labwor. <verse eid="DAN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 6:8" />Pimeno kombedi in rwot myero imok cik ci iket cingi i buk ma kicoyo iye cik ma pe kiloko atata, kit macalo cik pa jo Medi ki Percia tye kwede, ma pe kiloko atatani.” <verse eid="DAN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 6:9" />Pimeno rwot Dario oketo cinge i buk me cik kun moko cik man.<verse eid="DAN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 6:10" />Ikare ma dong Daniel ongeyo ni kiketo cing i buk me cik, ci oa ocito i ode odonyo i kicikane matye malo matye ki wang dirica, ci oyabo dirica ma okemo tung Jerucalem; ci obedo karumu conge piny kalega kun miyo pwoc bot Lubangane tyen adek nino ki nino, kit macalo yam con kong obedo katimoneni.<verse eid="DAN 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 6:11" />Lacen jonu gucako bino bot Daniel kit macalo onongo dong gutyeko yubuneni, ci gunongo Daniel tye kalega kun bako doge bot Lubangane. <verse eid="DAN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 6:12" />Ka gudok cen gucito inyim rwot, gunyiko cok ci gucako wace lok ma dok ikom cik ma pe loke ni, “Ai rwot, onongo mono pe iketo cingi i buk me cik ma pe loke atatani, kun iciko ni kace kibinongo ngat mo kalego lubanga mo nyo kaworo dano mo mukene ma pe in rwot, pi nino pyere adek, dano macalo meno kibibolo woko ikin lwak labwor?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 6:12">Ci rwot odok iye botgi ni, “Lok meno pud ocung matek kit macalo cik pa jo Medi ki Percia tye kwede, ma pe kitwero lokone atatani.”<verse eid="DAN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 6:13" />Ci gumede ki tito lok bot rwot ni, “Wanongo Daniel ma en ngat acel ikin jo mayam kiyakogi ki i Juda, pe lubu ciki, ai rwot, kadi wa cik ma pe loke ma iketo iye cingi i buki, ento bedo mere kalego Lubangane tyen adek nino ki nino.”<verse eid="DAN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 6:14" />Ikare ma dong rwot owinyo lok magi ducu, cwinye ocwer mada, ci obedo ki tam pi laro Daniel. Rwot oyele matek ki tam i cwinye nio ka ceng opoto, kun yenyo kit yo ma myero elar ki Daniel. <verse eid="DAN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 6:15" />Lacen jo magi dok gubino kacel bot rwot, kit macalo onongo dong guyubu kwede, ci guwaco bot rwot ni, “Ai rwot, myero inge ni, man aye cik pa jo Medi ki jo Percia ni, cik mo ma rwot dong omoko pe twero loke.”<verse eid="DAN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 6:16" />Cutcut rwot omiyo twero, ci kicito kikelo Daniel ci kibolo woko ikin lwak labwor. Ci rwot owaco bot Daniel ni, “Omyero Lubangani ma iworo jwijwini tin dong olari ba!” <verse eid="DAN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 6:17" />Kikelo got acel madit ci kiloro ki dog boro pa lwak labwori woko, ka rwot bene odiyo agit cinge i odok ma kimwono ki got meno kacel ki agit cing pa luditone me awora, ma moko ni myero pe kilok gin mo pi lok kom Daniel. <verse eid="DAN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 6:18" />Lacen rwot ocako dok i gangkal ma mere, ci obedo karii kec dyewor benebene; gin mo pe ma kitero bote me yomo cwinye, nino bene okwero mako wange woko.<verse eid="DAN 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 6:19" />Ikare ma piny dong oyabe odiko, rwot oa malo ci okato woko ocito oyotoyot tutwal i dog boro pa labwor. <verse eid="DAN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 6:20" />Ka dong oo cok ki boro kama onongo Daniel tye iyeni, ci odange kun kok matek pi remcwiny, ci owaco bot Daniel ni, “Ai Daniel, latic pa Lubanga makwo, en Lubangani ma iworo jwijwini mono dong otwero lari ki i dog lwak labwor magi?”<verse eid="DAN 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 6:21" />Ci Daniel odok ki rwot ni, “Ai rwot, bed kwo nakanaka! <verse eid="DAN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 6:22" />Lubangana ocwalo Lamalaika otweyo dog lwak labwor magi woko, ma omiyo pe gumwoda woko, pien gunongo ni pe atye ki bal mo inyime, kadi wa inyimi bene, ai rwot, pe atimo gin mo marac kadi ki acel.” <figure style="fig" alt="Daniel is thrown in the den of lions" file="co01386b.TIF" size="col" loc="Dan 6:22" copy="David Cook" ref="6:22">Kibolo Daniel i boro pa labwor</figure> <verse eid="DAN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 6:23" />Lok meno omiyo rwot obedo ki yomcwiny matek, ci omiyo twero ni kikwany Daniel woko ki i boro pa labwor kikele woko kamaleng. Pe kimedo kinongo kadi latin ret mo ikome wa ki acel, pien onongo en obedo kageno Lubangane. <verse eid="DAN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 6:24" />Cutcut rwot ociko ni kikel jo ma gudoto Danieli, ci kibologi woko i boro ikin lwak labwor, gin ducu kacel ki mongi wa ki lutinogi. Ento ma pud peya gupoto piny ite boro, labwor ogamogi woko lamal likapkap ci gumwodogi gutyero cogogi woko lipwacpwac.<verse eid="DAN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 6:25" />Lacen rwot Dario ocoyo waraga bot lwak me lobo ducu, ki rok mapatpat, kadi wa bot jo maloko leb mapatpat ma gibedo i lobo ducu kun waco ni,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 6:25">“Kuc myero onya omede botwu. <verse eid="DAN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 6:26" />Aketo kombedi cik ni i kabedo ducu ma ite loca maditi ni dano ducu myero komgi obed ki lworo inyim Lubanga pa Daniel, pien en aye Lubanga makwo, ma bedo nakanaka; kere bene pe kituru, loce bene pe bigik.<verse eid="DAN 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 6:27" />Lubangane laro dano dok konyogi bene, tiyo lanyut ki tango ducu i polo ki i lobo, pien en aye ma olaro Daniel ki i teko pa lwak labwor.”<verse eid="DAN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 6:28" />Ma omiyo Daniel olimo gum ki lonyo madwong ikare me loc pa Dario ki ikare me loc pa Ciro ma jo Percia.<verse eid="DAN 6:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DAN 7" />
  <para style="ms">Gin ma Daniel oneno iwang lek</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="DAN 7:1-12:13">7:1—12:13</ref></para>
  <para style="s1">Daniel oneno lee angwen i wang lek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 7:1" />I mwaka mukwongo me loc pa Belcajar rwot me Babilon, an Daniel aleko lek dok bene ginanyuta obino iwiya ikare ma abutu iwi kitandana. Ci acoyo gin ma an alekoni woko piny, dok atito kit leke woko bene kore ki kore.<verse eid="DAN 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 7:2" />I ginanyuta ma aneno i dyewor ki iwang lek; aneno yamo kodo ki itwok lobo angwen ducu kun rubu pii me nam madit. <verse eid="DAN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 7:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:1">Niy 13:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 17:8">17:8</ref></char></note>Ci cutcut aneno lee madito angwen gukati woko ki i nam, kun lee acel acel nen pat mada ki lawote. <verse eid="DAN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 7:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:2">Niy 13:2</ref></char></note>Lee mukwongo onongo nen calo labwor, dok onongo tye ki bwome macalo bwom ocur. Ikare ma abedo kaneno ci kiputu bwome woko kiilo woko ki i ngom ci kiketo ocung ki tyene aryo calo dano; ci kimiye bene cwiny pa dano.<verse eid="DAN 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 7:5" />Dok aneno lee mukene me aryone, onongo nen calo nguu, ma ocung ki tyene tung angec. En onongo tye ki cogo ringo laknget adek idoge ikin lake. Ci kitite ni, “A malo, imwod ringo madwong.”<verse eid="DAN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 7:6" />Inge man, dok aneno lee mukene ma obedo calo kwac, matye ki bwome angwen macalo bwom winyo i ngeye; onongo wiye tye angwen, dok bene kimiye loc.<verse eid="DAN 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 7:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 12:3">Niy 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:1">13:1</ref></char>
    </note>Inge man ki i dyewor aneno ginanyuta, ci aneno lee me angwene. Lee meno ger mamiyo kom dano myel marac ma lworo nongo oketo komgi woko, dok tekone dwong ma pe wace; lake ducu obedo nyonyo matek; obedo kamwodo ringo lee tyero woko lipwacpwac, ka dong onyono gin mudonge woko piny ki tyene. Onongo nen pat tutwal ki lee mukene ma gukwongo nyime ca, onongo tunge tye apar kulu. <verse eid="DAN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 7:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:5-6">Niy 13:5-6</ref></char></note> Ma abedo katamo lok ikom tunge apari, ci aneno tunge mukene matidi dok otwi olot ki ikin luwote. En odongo ci oputu tunge adek ki ikin gin mukwongo twini woko pi weke kabedo, ci aneno wang tye i tung lee man ma obedo calo wang dano, ma doge onongo tye kaloko lok mogo me wake adada.<verse eid="DAN 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ginanyuta ikom ngat mayam obedo kwo naka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 7:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 20:4">Niy 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:14">1:14</ref></char>
    </note>Ikare ma abedo kanenone, ci aneno, kicibo komker mogo ci ngat mayam okwongo bedo kwo naka obino obedo iwi komker acel. Bongone tar calo pee, dok bene yer wiye rom ki yer romo ma kilwoko odoko matar adada. Komkere obedo leb mac malyel ki lawala tyene obedo mac matye kawang. <verse eid="DAN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 7:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:11">Niy 5:11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:12">20:12</ref></char></note>Laora kulu me mac ocako mol, kun mol a ki inyime kati woko. Dano alip ki alip gitiyo bote; ki jo alip apar tyen alip apar gibedo kacung inyime, ci langolkop ocako bedo ki kot pi ngolo kop, ci omiyo en oyabo buk.<verse eid="DAN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 7:11" />Abedo kaneno piny i cawa meno pi lok me nyate ki me wake ma tung lee onongo tye kalokone. Ikare ma abedo kanenone, ci kineko lee meno woko, ka kiwango kome ki mac kityeko woko liweng. <verse eid="DAN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 7:12" />Dong lee mukeneni ducu kikwanyo loc woko ki botgi, ento kiwekogi ni kong gubed kwo i lobo pi kare mo manok.<verse eid="DAN 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 7:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:30">Mat 24:30</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:64">26:64</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:26">Mar 13:26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:62">14:62</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:27">Luk 21:27</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Niy 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13">13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 14:14">14:14</ref></char>
    </note>I dyewor meno, aneno ginanyuta macalo magi: cutcut aneno ngat mo macalo dano, kun lor bino piny ki pol me polo. Ci obino bot ngat mayam okwongo bedo kwo waconi, ci kitere bene wa inyime. <verse eid="DAN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 7:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:15">Niy 11:15</ref></char></note> Kitingo loc ducu kimiyo i cinge, kacel ki ker ducu ki deyone, wek lwak me rok ducu ki kaka ducu, ki jo maloko leb mapatpat ducu, gubed lutice. Loce aye loc ma bedo matwal, loce pe bigik, ki kere bene pe kitwero turune.<verse eid="DAN 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kitito te lok me ginanyuta magi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 7:15" />An Daniel, cwinya onongo obale woko pi lek ma obino iwiya ma opoyo tipu koma. <verse eid="DAN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 7:16" />Ci acito anyiko cok bot ngat mo acel ikin jo ma onongo gucung ka kenyo, ci apenye kun amito ni en otita telok magi ducu. En otita ci oweko angeyo te loke ducu, kun waco ni, <verse eid="DAN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 7:17" />“Lee tim magi angwen madito ni gin aye luker angwen ma gibia ki i lobo. <verse eid="DAN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 7:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:5">Niy 22:5</ref></char></note>Ento jo maleng pa Ngat Mamalo Twal aye gibicamo ker, dok gibibedo wegi ker nakanaka.”<verse eid="DAN 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 7:19" />Dok amito tutwal me ngeyo lok ada ma dok ikom lee me angwene ma onongo nen mapat ki lee mukeneni ducu, ma onongo ger mamiyo kom dano myel marac, ma lworo onongo oketo dano wokoni. Lake ducu obedo nyonyo, ki lwete ducu obedo mola, ma obedo kamwodo ringo lee tyero cogogi woko lipwacpwac, ka dok onyono gin mudonge woko piny ki tyene. <verse eid="DAN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 7:20" />Abedo katamo lok ikom tunge apar ma onongo tye iwiyeni, ki ikom tunge mukene ma dok otwi olot ki ikin luwote, kun otwi ma onongo putu tunge adek ikom gin ma gukwongo twini pi weke kabedo. En tung lee ma onongo wange tye ma obedo calo wang danoni, kun doge bene tye ma obedo kaloko kwede lok me wake adada. Onongo en dit makato lee luwote mukeneni woko.<verse eid="DAN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 7:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 13:7">Niy 13:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikare ma abedo kanenone, ci aneno tung lee meno oero lweny ikom jo maleng, ci otayogi woko. <verse eid="DAN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 7:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 20:4">Niy 20:4</ref></char></note> Lacen ngat mayam okwongo bedo kwo nakani obino, ci ongolokop pa jo maleng pa Ngat Mamalo Twal, ka dong kare oo ci jo maleng gugamo ker woko.<verse eid="DAN 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 7:23" />Te lok ma kimiya ikom lee me angweneni tye kit man ni, “Ker me angwen bibedo tye i lobo; kere bibedo pat ki ker mukeneni ducu. Ker man bicamo jo me lobo tyeko woko ducu, ci binyonogi woko piny ki tyene, dok nginyogi woko matinotino. <verse eid="DAN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 7:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:12">Niy 17:12</ref></char></note>Dong lok ikom tung lee apari tye kit man: tye luker apar ma gibia ki ite ker man, dok rwot acel mukene bia ki ingegi: en bibedo pat mada ki luker ma gukwongo nyimeni, dok bene bituru ker pa luker adek woko. <verse eid="DAN 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 7:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:14">Niy 12:14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:5-6">13:5-6</ref></char></note>En biloko lok marac ikom Ngat Mamalo Twal, biunu jo maleng pa Ngat Mamalo Twali. Bitemo loko karegi me woro Lubanga, ki cik ma en omiyogi. Kibimiyo jo maleng i cinge pi mwaka adek ki nucu. <verse eid="DAN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 7:26" />Lacen kibibedo ki kot pi ngolo kop ikome, ci kikwanyo loce woko ki bote, kun kibalo dok kityeko woko matwal nio wa i agikine. <verse eid="DAN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 7:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 20:4">Niy 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:5">22:5</ref></char></note>Dong ker ki loc ki dit me ker ducu matye ite polo kibimiyo woko bot lwak pa jo maleng pa Ngat Mamalo Twal. Kergi bibedo ker ma bedo nakanaka, kun loc me lobo ducu bibedo kaworogi dok gibilubu cikgi.”<verse eid="DAN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 7:28" />Dong agiki me lok man tye kit man. An Daniel, tama omiyo cwinya opoto matek, ki koma bene obale woko; ento akano lok man i cwinya pira kena.<verse eid="DAN 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DAN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ginanyuta me nyok romo ki nyok dyel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 8:1" />I mwaka me adek me loc pa rwot Belcajar, an Daniel aneno ginanyuta iwang lek, ki inge ginanyuta mukwongo ca. <verse eid="DAN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 8:2" />Ikare ma aneno ginanyuta ki iwang lek anongo ni dong atye wa i gangkal madit me Cuca, matye i lobo Elam; dok bene aneno ni atye wa i dog kulu Ulai. <verse eid="DAN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 8:3" />Ailo wanga malo ci aneno nyok romo ocung iwi tera i dog kulu. Nyok romonu onongo tunge tye aryo; tunge aryoni ducu giboco, ento acel ma otwi laceni onongo dok bor kato lawote. <verse eid="DAN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 8:4" />Aneno nyok romo kawite ki tek kun loko tunge tung kupotoceng ki tung kumalo, kaloke tung kupiny bene, ma lee tim mo onongo pe twero cung inyime. Onongo lee mo peke matwero juke onyo lare ki i tekone. En yam timo gin ma iye mito kun dwore kekene.<verse eid="DAN 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 8:5" />Ikare ma abedo kalwodo lok cutcut aneno nyok dyel obino kun oa ki tung kupotoceng ma ngolo dye lobo ducu arii, matyene pe gudu ngom; nyok dyel meno onongo tye ki tunge ikin wange manen wa ki cen. <verse eid="DAN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 8:6" />Nyok dyelu oa obino bot nyok romo matye ki tunge aryoni, ma onongo aneno ocung iwi tera i dog kulu ca, ci ocako ringo ka lweny ikom nyok romo ki akemo madit adada. <verse eid="DAN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 8:7" />Aneno obino odire cok tutwal ki nyok romo, ci kolo ocako make ikom nyok romo ci otwomo nyok romo oturu, oputu tunge aryo ca woko; nyok romo onongo peke ki teko mo liweng me cung inyim nyok dyel. Nyok dyel orete woko piny i ngom ka onyone ki tyene; onongo pe tye ngat mo matwero laro nyok romo ki i teko pa nyok dyel meno. <verse eid="DAN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 8:8" />Meno omiyo nyok dyelu odwore kekene mukato kare; ento ikare ma onongo en pud teki, tunge maditi otur woko. Cutcut dok aneno tunge angwen mukene gutwi ma ginen ki cen ma gukemo twok lobo angwen ducu.<verse eid="DAN 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 8:9" />Dok aneno tunge mo matidi otwi okati ki ikom tunge acel ki ikin gi, olot mabor ci kerone okemo tung kupiny, tung kupotoceng ki tung kunyango, ma kemo kwede Lobo me Cike.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="fk">Lobo me Cike </char> en aye lobo Icrael. I ginacoya mukene kilwongo ni lobo me deyo. </note> <verse eid="DAN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 8:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:4">Niy 12:4</ref></char></note> En odongo odoko madit tutwal matwero lweny ikom mony me polo; ci obolo lakalatwe mogo woko piny i ngom, ci onyonogi woko ki tyene. <verse eid="DAN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 8:11" />Ocako dwore kekene nio kwede wa ikom Laker me mony meno; ci okwanyo gitum awanga me nino ducuni woko ki bote, ka ojwero ode malengi obalo woko. <verse eid="DAN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 8:12" />Dano gubedo katimo bal kunu ma ka tyero gitum awanga me nino ducu; ci gubwoto woro Lubanga woko. Gin ducu ma tung nyok dyelu obedo katiyo onongo cobe kakare.<verse eid="DAN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 8:13" />Ci awinyo lumalaika aryo ka giloko ma ngat acel waco bot lawote ni, “Ginanyuta magi ma kineno iwang leki mono bimede pi kare marom mene? Bal maliki mono bileyo ka gityer me nino ducuni pi kare marom mene? Pi kare marom mene mono ma mony me polo kacel ki mony me Ot pa Lubanga kibinyonogi woko piny?”<verse eid="DAN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 8:14" />Ci awinyo ka malaika acel wace ni, “Man birii pi nino alip aryo ki miya adek ma pe kibityero iye gitum me odiko ki me otyeno, ka lacen kibilonyo Ot pa Lubanga kidwoko ikit ma myero.”<verse eid="DAN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lamalaika Gabriel ogonyo te lok me ginanyuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 8:15" />Ikare ma onongo an Daniel aneno ginanyuta, abedo kayenyo yo me niang iye; ci cutcut aneno ngat mo ma ocung inyima manen calo dano. <verse eid="DAN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 8:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:19">Luk 1:19</ref></char></note>Ci awinyo dwon dano maloko oa ki i kulu Ulai, ci olwongo ni, “Gabriel, mii dano meno onge telok me ginanyuta ma en onenoni.” <verse eid="DAN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 8:17" />Ci ocako bino cok ki kama onongo acung iye. Ci ikare ma obino abedo ki lworo ci apoto aryebe woko piny. Ento en owaca ni, “In wod pa dano dong iniang ni, ginanyuta ma inenoni nyutu gin ma bitime kare me agiki.”<verse eid="DAN 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 8:18" />Ikare ma en tye kalok kweda, nino omako wanga woko acako nino nino matut kun akulu wanga i ngom; ento en oguda ci ociba acung ki tyena. <verse eid="DAN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 8:19" />En owaco bota ni, “Nen, abinyuti gin ma bitime lacen ikare me agiki me akemo pa Lubanga; pien loke kemo nino me agiki mayam kiciko pire con.<verse eid="DAN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 8:20" />Dong lok ma dok ikom nyok romo ma ineno ma tunge tye aryoni, magi gin aye luker me Media ki me Percia. <verse eid="DAN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 8:21" />Ento nyok dyel meno ocung pi rwot pa jo Grik; dong tunge madit ma ikin wangeni aye rwot pa jo Grik mukwongo. <verse eid="DAN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 8:22" />Dong tunge angwen mukene ma otwi i kaka tunge ma kituruni, ocung ma ka ker angwen ma bia ki i roke, ento tekogi pe bibedo rom ki mere.<verse eid="DAN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 8:23" />Ento lacen ki i agiki me loc pa ker angweni, ikare ma nongo lubalo welgi onya omede, ci rwot mo ma wange ocwiny bia cako loc, ci bibedo ngat ma toke tek, lagero, dok larweny dano. <verse eid="DAN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 8:24" />Tekone bibedo dit tutwal, ento man pe bibedo pi gin ma en tiyo pire kene. En bitiyo gin ma tyeko piny woko mamiyo lworo, gin ma en bitiyo ducu biwot maber, en bineko jo ma gin twoni oteka kacel ki rok pa jo maleng. <verse eid="DAN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 8:25" />Pi diro me bwolane, miyo en bimede ameda, dok bibedo kadwore kekene ki i tame. En bineko jo mapol tyekogi woko atura; dok bene bia lwenyo kadi wa ikom Laloc madit maloyo luker ducu; ento kibiture woko ento pe ki teko pa dano. <verse eid="DAN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 8:26" />Ginanyuta maloko ikom gitum me odiko ki otyeno gire obedo ada; dong igwok mung me ginanyuta man, pien pud kare me cobene pud tye mabor.”<verse eid="DAN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 8:27" />Dong an Daniel, kerona onongo otum woko, omiyo two omaka abutu kwede piny pi nino mogo; ka lacen aa acito katiyo tic pa rwot; ento abedo kauru ginanyuta meno ma aneno iwang leki, dok pe amedo ki niang itere wa ki acel.<verse eid="DAN 8:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DAN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Daniel olego pi lutugi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 9:1" />Dario wod pa Akacwero, ma en anywali pa jo Media, odoko rwot, ci oloyo ker pa jo Kaldaya. <verse eid="DAN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 9:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:11">Jer 25:11</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:10">29:10</ref></char></note>I mwaka mukwongo me loce, an Daniel onongo atye kakwano ki i buk maleng kun alwodo bene ikom mwaki pyere abiro ma onongo Jerucalem bidoko iye obur; malube ki lok mayam Rwot onyutu bot lanebi Jeremia.<verse eid="DAN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 9:3" />Ci aloko wanga bot Rwot Lubanga, kun alego dok abako doga bote, kun arii kec ma aruku bongo cola ma abuku koma ki buru bene. <verse eid="DAN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 9:4" />Abedo kalega inyim Rwot Lubangana ma atucu bal pa jona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 9:4">An awaco ni, “Ai Rwot Lubanga, in idit, dok wabedo ki lworo inyimi. In Lubanga me ada dok in lagen dok igwoko gicikeni kun inyutu mar meri ma pe loke bot jo ma gimari dok ma gilubu ciki. <verse eid="DAN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 9:5" />Watyeko timo bal, wabedo lubalo, kun watimo bene gin maracu adada. Wajemo woko ikomi, waloko ngewa woko boti, pe walubu ciki; dok bene pe watiyo gin ducu mayam iciko. <verse eid="DAN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 9:6" />Pe wabedo kawinyo lok pa lutici ma gin lunebi, ma gubedo katito lok ducu ki nyingi bot lukerwa, rwodiwa, ki bot kwariwa kacel ki bot lwak ducu ma gibedo i lobowa.<verse eid="DAN 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 9:7" />Ai Rwot, kit ma atir gire tye boti keken, ento ki tung botwa lewic dong obalo wangwa woko, kit macalo otime kwede inino man ikom wan jo Juda, ikom jo ma bedo i Jerucalem, ki ikom jo Icrael ducu, jo ma bedo kamacok ki jo ma gibedo kamabor, i lobo mayam iryemogi iterogi iye ducu, pien gin onongo pe gubedo jo ma lugen inyimi. <verse eid="DAN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 9:8" />Ai Rwot lewic dong nen ikom wangwa ducu, kacel ki ikom lukerwa, rwodiwa, ki kwariwa, pien onongo watimo bal inyimi. <verse eid="DAN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 9:9" />Kica ki weko bal tye boti Rwot Lubangawa, kadi bed onongo wajemo woko ikomi. <verse eid="DAN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 9:10" />Pe wabedo kawinyo lok dogi Rwot Lubangawa, dok pe walubu cik ma onongo in iketo pirwa ma owok ki bot lutici ma lunebi. <verse eid="DAN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 9:11" />Jo Icrael ducu guturu ciki woko, ka guloko ngegi woko boti, gukwero winyo lok dogi ma ibedo kaloko botgi. Pimeno oweko lok me ceno dano ki lok me lamo dog mayam kicoyo i buk pa Moses ma en latici, kikwanyo kionyo woko ikomwa, pien dong watimo bal inyimi. <verse eid="DAN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 9:12" />In dong icobo gin mayam iloko ikomwa ki ikom luloc ma onongo giloyowa. Dok bene ityeko pwodo Jerucalem ki lakit pwod magwar mayam pud peya onen ikom taun madit mo matye piny ite polo. <verse eid="DAN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 9:13" />Kadi bed can madit man opoto ikomwa, kit macalo kicoyo i buk me cik pa Moses, ento pe walego kica bot Rwot Lubangawa, pe waweko balwa ducu, kun wamine kenwa me lubu ada ma meri. <verse eid="DAN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 9:14" />Meno aye gin ma omiyo in Rwot ikano can madit pirwa, ka lacen iketo ikomwa; pien in Rwot Lubangawa in ipore i gin ducu ma in itiyo, ento wan aye pe wabedo kawinyo loki. <verse eid="DAN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 9:15" />Kombedi dong, ai Rwot Lubangawa, yam ikwanyo joni woko ki i lobo Ejipt ki tekoni, yam imiyo nyingi oywek iye, kit macalo tye kwede ikare man, ento onongo wabalo, dok watimo gin maracu adada. <verse eid="DAN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 9:16" />Ai Rwot, kit macalo gin ducu ma itiyo tye atir, jwa kinigani ki akemoni woko ki ikom Jerucalem ma en aye taun madit maleng, pien pi bal mewa, ki pi bal mapol mayam kwariwa gutimo, omiyo Jerucalem kacel ki lwaki gudoko lok aboka ki ikin rok ducu ma gibedo kangetwa ma gurumuwa dyere. <verse eid="DAN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 9:17" />Pimeno kombedi, ai Lubangawa, winy legana an latici, ki lega me bako dog ma akelo inyimi. Dok bene ai Rwot, loke inenwa ki wangi me kica wek iroc Ot meri maleng, ma dong odoko oburri. <verse eid="DAN 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 9:18" />Ai Lubangana, cik iti iwinywa, yab wangi ci inen topiny ma opoto ikomwa, ki ikom taun madit ma kilwongo ki nyingini. Pe wabako dogwa boti kun wageno ni kitwa tye atir, ento pi geno kica meri madwong. <verse eid="DAN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 9:19" />Ai Rwot, winywa ba. Ai Rwot, wek balwa. Ai Rwot, tii gin mo pirwa, pe igale, pi nyingi keni keken. Ai Lubangana, pien taun madit man kacel ki lwak ducu ma gibedo iye kilwongogi ki nyingi.”<verse eid="DAN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gabriel ogonyo te lok me Nebi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 9:20" />Ikare ma abedo kamede kalok kun alego, atucu bala ki pa lutuwa jo Icrael, kun bene akelo lega me bako doga inyim Rwot Lubangana pi Ot mere maleng. <verse eid="DAN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 9:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:19">Luk 1:19</ref></char></note>Ikare ma atye kalok kun alego kwede, cutcut atugi neno lamalaika ma nyinge Gabriel, ma onongo dong atyeko nenone iwang lek i ginanyuta mukwongo ca. En obino bota kun ngweco madwir adada i cawa me gitum me otyeno. <verse eid="DAN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 9:22" />En obino ci owaca ni, “Daniel, kombedi abino kamiyo boti ryeko ki niang ma oromo. <verse eid="DAN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 9:23" />I acaki lega me bako dogi, Lubanga omiya lagam me legani. Kombedi dong abino katiti lagame, pien Lubanga mari matek tutwal. Pimeno dong iwiny lok man maber wek iniang itelok me ginanyuta ma inenoni.<verse eid="DAN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 9:24" />Mwaka miya angwen ki pyere abongwen en aye kare ma kiciko ma okemo lutuwu ki taunwu madit maleng, pi tyeko bal me kwero lubu cik, pi giko bal woko dong matwal, ki pi kwanyo bal woko ki i komwu wek dong wulim kit ma atir ma bedo nakanaka, wek ginanyuta kacel ki lok mayam lanebi oloko ocobe kakare, dok bene pi dyero kabedo maleng makato ducu odoco. <verse eid="DAN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 9:25" />Dong amito inge dok iniang maber ni, nia ikare ma lok man cito kwede woko pi roco ki pi gero Jerucalem odoco, nio wa ibino pa dano ma kiyero ma en laker, bibedo mwaka pyere angwen wiye abongwen. Ci Jerucalem bibedo mwaka miya angwen ki pyere adek wiye angwen ma dong kigero odoco ki dye kale ki cel lobo ma kitoro atora, ento meno bibedo ikare ma nongo ayelayela dong dwong adada. <verse eid="DAN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 9:26" />Inge mwaka miya angwen ki pyere adek wiye angwen, ngat ma kiyeroni kibineko woko i yo ma pe tye kakare. Laker matek adada bibalo taun madit kacel ki kabedo maleng woko. Agikine bibino macalo pii aluka, ma lweny ki bale pa jami bibedo teretere nio wa i agiki kit mayam Lubanga oyubu. Man aye topiny mayam kiciko pireni. <verse eid="DAN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 9:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:31">Dan 11:31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12:11</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:15">Mat 24:15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14">Mar 13:14</ref></char></note>Laloc meno bimoko gicike ki jo mapol pi mwaka abiro; ci ka mwaka adek ki nucu dong okato, en bijuku gitum ki gityer woko. Laloc meno bikelo gin me kwer malik me topiny ci biketone kama lamal makato matye i kabedo maleng i Ot pa Lubanga, nio ka Lubanga bityeko ngat ma oketoni woko kit mayam oyubu.”<verse eid="DAN 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DAN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ginanyuta ma Daniel oneno inget kulu Tigric</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 10:1" />(I mwaka me adek me loc pa Ciro rwot me Percia Lubanga onyutu lok mo bot Daniel, ma nyinge mukene Beltecajar. Loke obedo lok ada, ento onongo tek tutwal me niang tere. Ci Daniel oniang tere matut i ginanyuta ma en dok oneno.)<verse eid="DAN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 10:2" />Ikare meno ducu, onongo an Daniel abedo kakumu pi cabit adek kulu. <verse eid="DAN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 10:3" />Pe abedo kacamo cam mo mamit, pe acamo ringo kadi ki kongo bwino bene pe odonyo idoga, dok pe awiro koma ki moo wa ki acel, pi cabit adeki kulu. <verse eid="DAN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 10:4" />Inino dwe pyere aryo wiye angwen me dwe mukwongo, anongo ni acung i dog kulu madit, ma en aye Tigric. <verse eid="DAN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 10:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:13-15">Niy 1:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:18">2:18</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:12">19:12</ref></char></note> Atingo wanga aneno malo ci aneno dano mo ma oruku bongo camanini, ma otweyo pyere ki del jabu me Upaj. <verse eid="DAN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 10:6" />Kome onongo obedo calo got berul ma mil amila, ki tur nyime nen calo lutkot ma wil, ki wange ryeny calo mac, bade ki tyene ducu onongo nen calo mola ma kirudu maleng adada, ki loke ma en loko winye calo woo pa lwak dano mapol. <verse eid="DAN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 10:7" />An Daniel keken aye ma aneno ginanyuta. Jo ma onongo gitye kacel kweda pe guneno, ento myelkom madit opoto ikomgi, ci guringo gukane woko. <verse eid="DAN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 10:8" />Guweka adong kena, ci aneno ginanyuta man madit. Ikare ma dong aneno ci teko mo pe odong ikoma; kit ber me koma oloke woko ma ngat mo keken pe romo ngeyo an. <verse eid="DAN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 10:9" />Ka dong awinyo dwone ki lok ma en obedo kalokone, ci apoto piny aryebaic ci anino nino to adada ma pe angeyo koma.<verse eid="DAN 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 10:10" />Cutcut cing dano mo oguda omiyo agungu ki wi cinga ki conga ma koma myel matek. <verse eid="DAN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 10:11" />En dano meno owaca ni, “Daniel, in Lubanga mari adada, cik iti wek iwiny lok ducu ma atye kalokone boti. A itire icung atir, pien an kombedi kiora boti.” Ikare ma onongo en pud tye kaloko lok meno, aa malo acung ma koma myel amyela likwak kwak. <verse eid="DAN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 10:12" />Ka lacen en owaco ni, “Daniel, pe ilwor, pien cake inino mukwongo ma iketo kwede cwinyi kaniang ki ka mwole woko keni inyim Lubangani, loki ducu dong onongo Lubanga otyeko winyone. Nen an dong atyeko bino macalo lagam me loki. <verse eid="DAN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 10:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:7">Niy 12:7</ref></char></note>Lamalaika ma en laker maloyo ker me Percia onongo ogenga woko pi nino pyere aryo wiye acel kulu. Ci Mikael, ma en ngat acel madit maloyo lumalaika ducu, oa obino kakonya pien onongo kiweka adong kunu kena. <verse eid="DAN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 10:14" />An abino kaniangi wek inge can ma bipoto ikom rokwu ikare me lacen. Pien ginanyuta man ma inenoni bene loke bitime ikare ma pud tye anyim.”<verse eid="DAN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 10:15" />Ikare ma en dong oloko bota kit lok macalo magi ducu, akulu wanga piny i ngom adoko calo ladoge oto. <verse eid="DAN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 10:16" />Ci lamalaika ma nen calo danoni ogudu del doga; ci angamo doga aloko bene. Awaco bot en ngat ma onongo ocung inyimani ni, “Ai rwoda, pi tyen lok me ginanyuta man ma aneno, omiyo arem mapol obino ikoma, pe dong atye ki teko mo wa ki acel. <verse eid="DAN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 10:17" />An abedo calo opii ma ocung inyim rwode, atwero ngwete kalok kwedi ningning? Pien kombedi teko mo dong pe odong ikoma liweng, dok bene aluu mo ma odong icwinya peke.”<verse eid="DAN 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 10:18" />Lacen dok ngat manen calo danoni oguda tyen me aryo ci omiya teko. <verse eid="DAN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 10:19" />Ka dong owaca ni, “In Lubanga mari adada, pe ilwor; ibibedo maber dok ki kuc. Bed ki keru dok tekcwiny.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 10:19">Ikare ma oloko kweda, alimo teko kun awaco ni, “In rwoda aye dong iloki, pien dong ityeko miya teko.”<verse eid="DAN 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 10:20" />En openya ni, “In ingeyo tyen lok ma omiyo abino botini? Ento kombedi dong abiloke adok ka lweny ikom lamalaika ma laker maloyo ker me Percia. Ka dong atyeko lweny kwede, ci nen, lamalaika ma laker maloyo ker me Grik bibino. <verse eid="DAN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 10:21" />Ento an myero atit boti gin ma kicoyo i buk me lok ada. Pe tye ngat mo matye kangeta ma konya kilweny ikom jo magi kono Mikael keken, ma malaika ma gwoko jo Icrael.<verse eid="DAN 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DAN 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 11:1" />I mwaka mukwongo me loc pa Dario ma en jo Medi, an aa malo kakonye ki kamiye teko. <verse eid="DAN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 11:2" />Kombedi dong abinyuti lok me ada.”</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="DAN 11:2">Ker me Ejipt ki me Aciria</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 11:2">Ci lamalaikanu owaco bota ni, “Lobo Percia dok bibedo ki luker mukene adek; ento rwot me angwene ma bilubugi bibedo lalonyo makatogi ducu; ka dong inen odoko tek pi lwak lonyone ducu, ci en bitugu rok ducu pi lweny ikom ker pa jo Grik.<verse eid="DAN 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 11:3" />Lacen rwot matek bituc, ma biloyo lobo ki loc madit kun tiyo gire gin ducu kit ma iye mito. <verse eid="DAN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 11:4" />Ento ka dong ineno en ocako loc kitmeno ci kere bitur woko poke i dul angwen; ker me kumalo, me kupiny, me kunyango ki me kupotoceng. Rwodi ma biloyo ker magi pe bibedo likwaye, dok pe bilubu kit loc ma onongo en loyo kwede lobo; pien kibitingo kere woko ki bere kimiyo bot jo mukene ma pe likwaye.<verse eid="DAN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 11:5" />Dok rwot maloyo lobo me Ejipt bibedo matek, ento ngat acel ki ikin rwodine bibedo tek makato en, dok loce bene bibedo loc madit. <verse eid="DAN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 11:6" />Inge mwaka mogo rwot me Ejipt biribe woko ki rwot me Ciria pi yubu lok me kelo kuc, ci bimiyo en nyomo nyare woko. Ento ribe man me kuci pe bibedo pi kare malac, ci dakonu gin ki cware, latine, kacel ki lutice ma gucito kwede ikare ma kinyome i loboneni kibinekogi woko bene.<verse eid="DAN 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 11:7" />Ikare meno ngat acel ki ikin wadi pa dakonu aye bidoko rwot. Ci en bibino ka lweny ikom dul mony me Aciria ci donyo wa i gang ma kirumu ki cel gogo pa rwot me Aciria; en bilwenyo ikomgi ci biloyogi bene. <verse eid="DAN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 11:8" />En bicoko lwak lubangagi ki cal jogigi ma kiliyo aliya ki jami me wel ma kitiyo ki ryal ki jabu, ci terogi i Ejipt; ka dong pi mwaka mogo en kong dong bibedo ma pe dok lwenyo ikom rwot maloyo lobo me Aciria. <verse eid="DAN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 11:9" />Lacen rwot me Aciria bibino lwenyo ikom rwot me Ejipt, ento biloke dok gire i lobone kikome.<verse eid="DAN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 11:10" />Awobe pa rwot me Aciria gibiero mony ci gibiguru lumony mapol kacel. Ngat acel ki ikin gi bibino ikom lukworgi calo pii aluka ci lwenyo matek ma tero mony wa i cel gogone. <verse eid="DAN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 11:11" />Ci kiniga bimako rwot me lobo me Ejipt matek, ci miyo en bibino ka lweny ikom rwot me lobo me Aciria; biguru lwak mony madit, ci kibimiyo lukwore i cinge bene. <verse eid="DAN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 11:12" />Ka dong oneko acikari alip ki alip, ci bibedo ki wake i cwinye; ento pe bibedo laloyo matwal. <verse eid="DAN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 11:13" />Rwot me lobo me Ciria pud bimede ki coko lwak lumony mapol maloyo jo ma wiati ca; ka dong inge mwaka mogo en cako bino ki mony madit ki lwak jami me lweny mapol.<verse eid="DAN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 11:14" />Ikare meno ducu dul mony mapol bicako lweny ikom rwot me lobo me Ejipt; dok lutim bwami ma ikin lutuwu kikome gibingwete me cobo telok me ginanyuta, ento pe gibitwero. <verse eid="DAN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 11:15" />Dok rwot me lobo me Aciria bibino rumu taun madit, ci mako taun madit meno woko ma kirumu ki cel gogo maber adadani. Ento dul lulweny ma gibia ki i lobo me Ejipt pe gibicung, kadi wa twoni lweny ma kiyerogi ayera, pien teko mo me cung bibedo peke botgi. <verse eid="DAN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 11:16" />Dong rwot me Ciria bibino ka lweny ikome bitime kit ma cwinye mito, ci ngat mo ma bijuku en pe bibedo tye. Monye bicung i lobo me deyoni, ci lobo meno ducu dong bibedo ite twerone.<verse eid="DAN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 11:17" />Rwot me Ciria bibedo ki yub me bino ki tek ite kere ducu, kun tiyo ki monye. Ci iyub ma mere me tyeko ker pa meroke woko, en bibedo calo tye ki yub me kelo kuc, ci bimiyo nyare wek rwot me Ejipt onyom; ento yube pe bicung dok kadi wa mede pa kere bibedo peke. <verse eid="DAN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 11:18" />Lacen en biloke ka lweny ikom lobo ma gitye tung dog nam, ci biloyogi woko. Ento latel wi mony ma larok biloyo en ci bikane woko pi lewic; ada, en dok bidwoko lewice cen ikom rwot me Ciria. <verse eid="DAN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 11:19" />Ci biloke dok cen i cel gogo me lobone kikome; ento kibiloye woko, ci man bibedo agiki me loce.<verse eid="DAN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 11:20" />Lacen ngat ma leyo kakare bibino ma bicwalo lajog mucoro ma bidiyo dano kajogo mucoro pi medo lonyo me kere; ento pi kare manok keken kibineke woko, pe ki ikin dano nyo i dog lweny mo.”<verse eid="DAN 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot ma lacira me Ciria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 11:21" />Lamalaika omede ki tito loke kun waco ni, “Rwot mukene me Ciria ma bileyo katyene bibedo dano mo malam dok lacira; en bibino atura ci mayo mere ker woko ki lok bita. <verse eid="DAN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 11:22" />Mony ducu ma bijemo ikome kibijwerogi kiturugi woko i nyime, kadi wa Ajwaka Madit pa Lubanga bene kibineko woko. <verse eid="DAN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 11:23" />En bibedo katic ki lok me bwola keken me yubu cike me ribe ki rok mogo; ci bimede doko tek kadi ka tye kaloyo rok manok mo keken. <verse eid="DAN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 11:24" />En bimonyo dul lobo ma lonyo dwong iye, ci bitiyo gin mo ma kwarine ducu onyo wegi kwarine yam pe gutiyo, me keyo luyak woko ki ikin gi liweng, ci bipoko jami ma kiyakoni ducu bot jone. En biyube me lweny ikom gangi me cel gogo matego, ento man bibedo pi kare manok mo keken.<verse eid="DAN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 11:25" />En bitugu lweny ikom rwot me lobo me Ejipt ki mony madit; ci rwot me Ejipt bilweny ki dul mony madit matek adada; ento en pe bitwero cungu, pien kibibedo ki yub mapol tutwal ikome. <verse eid="DAN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 11:26" />Kadi wa lumiitame aye ma bineke ma gibijwero monye woko, ci gineko lwak jo mapol ma komgi birade piny i ngom lirat. <verse eid="DAN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 11:27" />Dong luker aryoni gibibedo kacamo iwi meja acel, ento tam ma icwinygi bibedo kaparo lok me kwarcwiny keken; ci ngat man bibedo kaloko lok goba bot lawote. Ci pe gibinongo gin moni ma gimitoni, pien kare me cobo lokginu peya oromo, ento bitime ikare ma kiciko. <verse eid="DAN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 11:28" />Rwot me Ciria bidok i lobone ki lwak lonyo madwong ma oyakogini, ento pud bibedo ki kwarcwiny ikom gicike maleng, kun nongo omoko tame me tyeko dini pa Lujudaya woko. Dok en bitiyo kit gin ducu ma cwinye mito, kadong bidok cen i lobone kikome.<verse eid="DAN 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 11:29" />Ikare ma kiciko en biloke dwogo i Ejipt; ento man pe bibedo kit macalo yam obedo kwede wiati. <verse eid="DAN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 11:30" />Mony pa jo Roma gibibino ki lwak mel mapol ka lweny ikome. Lworo bimake ci juke woko kene. Ci en bidok woko cen ki ngeye, ci cako lweny ki akemo madit ikom dini pa Lujudaya. En bilubu tam pa jo ma dong gubwoto dini pa Lujudaya woko. <verse eid="DAN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 11:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12:11</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:15">Mat 24:15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14">Mar 13:14</ref></char></note>Dul mony mogo ma a ki bote bibino dok pyedo Ot pa Lubanga ki cel gogo woko, ci gibikwanyo gitum awanga ma kityero nino ducu woko ci gibiketo gin me kwer malik i Ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="DAN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 11:32" />En bitic ki bita kaywayo tam pa jo madong gubwoto dini pa Lujudaya woko; ento jo ma gingeyo Lubangagi gibicung liking ci gilwenyo bene matek pi niyegi. <verse eid="DAN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 11:33" />Dong jo mogo ma luryeko ma gitye ikin lwak gibimiyo jo mapol giniang, kadi bed kibinekogi woko ki pala lucwan, dok kiwangogi woko bene ki mac, nyo kiterogi i opii, ma kiyako jamigi woko pi kare mogo. <verse eid="DAN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 11:34" />Ikare ma nongo kitye kamede ki nekogi, jo pa Lubanga gibilimo kony mogo manoknok, ento pol jo ma biribe kwedgi pe gibibedo ki cwiny me ada ikomgi. <verse eid="DAN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 11:35" />Ci lutela ma luryeko mogo ma ikin gi kibinekogi woko, ento meno bimiyo lwak gilonye gidoko leng macalo jabu ma kiliyo maber, ci miyo gidoko maleng labongo cilo, nio ka kare me agiki oromo, ma en kare mayam Lubanga ociko.<verse eid="DAN 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 11:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TH 2:3-4">2 Tec 2:3-4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:5-6">Niy 13:5-6</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot me Ciria gire bitiyo gin ducu kit macalo cwinye mito; en bingwete me bedo dit makato lubangagu ducu, ka cako loko lok mogo me yet ikom Lubanga maloyo lwak lubangagu ducu. En bimede kun pud bedo ki dit wic nio katic me akemo pa Lubanga dong otum woko liweng; pien gin ma Lubanga omoko bitime. <verse eid="DAN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 11:37" />Rwot me Ciria pe bibedo ki woro mo liweng ikom lwak lubanga pa kwarine, nyo bot jok ma mon maro adadani; pe bimiyo kit winy mo bot lubangagu mukene, pien en bikete kene me bedo dit maloyo jami ducu. <verse eid="DAN 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DAN 11:38" />Ma ka worogi en bibedo kaworo lubangagu me cel gogo ma en aye lubanga mayam kwarine pe gungeyoni; en bityero bote jabu kacel ki ryal, ki kidi matino me wel, ki mot ma welgi malo adada. <verse eid="DAN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DAN 11:39" />En biketo lurok ma giworo lubangagu mapat pi gwoko cel gogo mere; jo ma guye dite en biketogi i rwom me dito ki deyo. En biketogi gibedo luloc ci giloyo jo mapol, dok bipoko lobo botgi me awila.<verse eid="DAN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DAN 11:40" />Ka kare me agiki pa rwot me Ciria dong cok, rwot me Ejipt bilweny ikome; ento rwot me Ciria birune bino ikome woko oyotoyot calo yamo lapiru, kun bino ki lwak gadigadi ki wegi aguragura, ki lwak mel madwong ata. En bibino ci bimonyo lobo mapol ata ci lumonye bipongo lobonu ducu macalo pii aluka. <verse eid="DAN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DAN 11:41" />En bibino wa i lobo me deyo me Icrael. En bineko jo alip ki alip woko, ento jo me rok magi aye gibibwot ki i cinge: jo Edom, jo Moab ki jo mogo ma gudong ki i lobo Ammon gibibwot. <verse eid="DAN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DAN 11:42" />En biryeyo cinge me lweny ikom lobo mapol, kadi ki lobo Ejipt bene pe bibwot. <verse eid="DAN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DAN 11:43" />En bikwanyo lonyo me jabu ki me ryal, ki jami me wel ma i Ejipt ducu; dok en bene biloyo lobo Libya ki Etiopia woko. <verse eid="DAN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DAN 11:44" />Ento lok ma biwinye kun a ki tung wokceng ki tung kumalo bimiyo cwinye poto; en bia cito kunu ki twon akeca madit kajwero dano woko ki neko jo mapol bene. <verse eid="DAN 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DAN 11:45" />En biguru kemane madito ikin nam ki got maleng<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:45 </char><char style="fk">Got maleng </char> en aye kama Ot pa Lubanga kigedo iye i Jerucalem.</note> me deyo; ci kibineko en kunu labongo ngat mo matwero konye.”<verse eid="DAN 11:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DAN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Kare me agiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:21">Mat 24:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:19">Mar 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:14">Niy 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:7">12:7</ref></char>
    </note> Lamalaikanu owaco ni, “Ikare meno Mikael bibino, ma en rwot madit maloyo rokwu. Dok kare me can bibedo tye, kit can malit adada ma peya onen nicake wa ikare ma rok ocake kwede nio kwede wa ikare meno. Ikare meno aye kibilaro iye rokwu, jo ma kibinongo yam kicoyo nyinggi i buk pa Lubanga. <verse eid="DAN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 12:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:19">Ica 26:19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:46">Mat 25:46</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 5:29">Jon 5:29</ref></char></note>Dok jo mapol ikom jo mayam dong guto woko gibikwo dok aye, jo mukene gibidonyo i kwo ma bedo nakanaka, ento jo mukene gibinongo meggi lewic ki cac ma bedo nakanaka. <verse eid="DAN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 12:3" />Jo maryek biryeny macalo pete me polo; ki jo ma giloko jo mapol dwogo ikit ma atir, gibidoko calo lakalatwe maryeny matwal. <verse eid="DAN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 12:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:10">Niy 22:10</ref></char></note>Ento in Daniel, um buk woko, ci imwon doge woko, nio wa ikare me agiki. Jo mapol gibibedo karingo tungi ki tungi, ki ngec bene bimede.”<verse eid="DAN 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 12:5" />Cutcut ki inge meno an Daniel aneno piny, ci aneno jo mukene aryo gucung i dog kulu, ngat acel ocung i dog kulu tungcel ki acel tungcel. <verse eid="DAN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 12:6" />Ci ngat acel ikin gi owaco bot lamalaika ma onongo oruku bongo camanini, matye malo iwi pii ma i kuluni ni, “Man bitero kare marom mene nio ka agiki me ginaura magi bio?”<verse eid="DAN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 12:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 10:5">Niy 10:5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:14">12:14</ref></char>
    </note>Ci lamalaika ma onongo oruku bongo camaninini ma obedo malo iwi pii ma i kuluni, otingo cinge aryo ducu okemo polo; ci awinyo en ka kwongo kwong ki nying ngat ma bedo matwali ni, “Gin meno bibedo pi mwaka adek ki nucu. Ka dong ineno nino me libo jo maleng otum ci jami magi ducu bene bitime cobe kakare.”<verse eid="DAN 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 12:8" />Awinyo, ento onongo pe aniang. Ma omiyo awaco ni, “Ai rwoda, agiki me jami magi bibedo ningning?” <verse eid="DAN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 12:9" />Ci en odok iye ni, “In icit meri citoni Daniel, pien pud kiumu loke, dok kimwono woko kuru kare me agiki. <verse eid="DAN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 12:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:11">Niy 22:11</ref></char></note>Jo mapol gibilonye, gibiloke gidoko maleng, kun bene kilonyogi odoco; ento jo maracu gibibedo meggi katimo gin maracu. Pe tye ngat mo ikin lutim maracu ma biniang iye; ento jo maryek aye biniang iye.<verse eid="DAN 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 12:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11:31</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:15">Mat 24:15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14">Mar 13:14</ref></char>
    </note>Cake ikare ma kikwanyo iye gitum awanga me nino ducu ca, kun dong kiketo gin me kwer malik, bibedo nino alip acel ki miya aryo ki pyere abongwen. <verse eid="DAN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 12:12" />Jo ma gibigwoke i niyegi nio ka nino alip acel ki miya adek ki pyere adek wiye abic oromo bibedo tye ki gum.<verse eid="DAN 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 12:13" />Dong in Daniel bed lagen nio wa i agiki. In ibito, ento lacen ibicer pi nongo mot ma meri ikare me agiki.”<verse eid="DAN 12:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 12" />
</usx>